mx-master-4-desktop (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian/Ubuntu packaging.
    - Builds the mx4-radial overlay and mx4-config GUI with CMake + Qt6.
    - Installs the mx4d Python daemon onto the system python (no venv/pip)
      via a /usr/bin/mx4d launcher.
    - Ships the udev rule, portable XDG autostart entry, systemd user units,
      and the Plasma-Wayland KWin focus-bridge script (as data, not enabled).

